    "body": "> time to time, Safari is getting Web compat reports about breakage because of the lack of `webkitGetUserMedia`.\r\n\r\n@karlcow did Safari expose this historically? Or was it just never implemented? \r\n\r\n> `navigator.getUserMedia` has been [\"removed\" from the standard](https://w3c.github.io/mediacapture-main/#legacy-getusermedia-interface)\r\n\r\nInteresting... I would expect non-zero breakage as a result (based on nothing but vibes and intuition).",
